# A currency rather than litter: it sells for nothing, and one falls from every
# clear. The triangle says which stage of the game it belongs to and the orange
# that it buys a secondary, as the Frozen token's circle and orange do a tier
# below.
name: "Captivating Fragment"
category: ITEM_CATEGORY_ETC
kind: ITEM_KIND_TOKEN
currency_level: 140
currency_slot: EQUIP_SLOT_SECONDARY
description:
  "A fragment imbued with Princess No's energy. The shop trades fifteen for "
  "any of her secondaries."
currency_mark: "▲"
currency_color: CURRENCY_COLOR_ORANGE
